1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
For iPhone users - a brilliant
feature in the Photos app.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,680
A really useful, simple tip.

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,420
Many of you may already know it.

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:10,790
This video is for those who don't.

5
00:00:10,790 --> 00:00:14,580
If you know it, share it with
them, then keep scrolling.

6
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:16,700
For more useful videos like this,

7
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,480
subscribe right now and follow me.

8
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:21,250
Liked the video? Hit like,

9
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,850
and share your thoughts in the comments.

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,320
Normally, when we open the Photos app,

11
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:30,210
we see everything like this - in squares.

12
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:33,540
Videos, photos - every one of them.

13
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:36,880
So when you post a WhatsApp
status, or upload a reel,

14
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:39,270
or use it for anything else,

15
00:00:39,270 --> 00:00:42,560
which photo suits a status?

16
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:45,950
Which video fits a status or a reel?

17
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,950
That's hard to tell from here.

18
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:49,870
A problem many of us face.

19
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:53,560
Which format is this
video - or this photo?

20
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:57,080
A simple tip to know exactly that.

21
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,900
So share it with everyone.

22
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:01,730
Now, to do this - it's very simple.

23
00:01:01,730 --> 00:01:03,370
Open the Photos app,

24
00:01:03,370 --> 00:01:06,400
and at the top you'll see
a three-line menu icon.

25
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:08,280
Just tap on it,

26
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:11,110
and here you'll find View Options.

27
00:01:11,110 --> 00:01:14,880
Tap that, Aspect Ratio
Grid is right there.

28
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:18,630
Select it - and then it looks like this:

29
00:01:18,630 --> 00:01:21,850
every photo and video in your gallery.

30
00:01:21,850 --> 00:01:25,230
So you can see the aspect ratio

31
00:01:25,230 --> 00:01:27,800
of each photo - exactly.

32
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:30,580
Uploading to a status or a reel?

33
00:01:30,580 --> 00:01:33,230
No trouble at all.

34
00:01:33,230 --> 00:01:36,490
If you like, zoom in, or zoom out,

35
00:01:36,490 --> 00:01:40,180
and set it up the way you want.

36
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:42,320
A really useful, simple tip, right?

37
00:01:42,340 --> 00:01:46,560
So share it with everyone - let
people know this is possible.

38
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:49,240
Anyway - with a new topic, see you again!

